  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 bpc-fetch contributors

Adapted into this project (src/bpc_web/vendor/):
  * strategy.py — per-site HTTP header strategies (Googlebot/Bingbot UA,
    Referer spoofing, X-Forwarded-For), payload heuristics.
  * sites.py   — parser for the Bypass Paywalls Clean `sites.js` table and the
    domain -> strategy lookup.

The site table (src/bpc_web/data/sites.js) comes from Bypass Paywalls Clean by
magnolia1234 (https://gitflic.ru/project/magnolia1234/bypass-paywalls-chrome-clean),
which is licensed GPL-3.0. It is used here as a data file only — a list of
domains and the request headers that unlock them — and is redistributed
unmodified.

